    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About us</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaveroid a new studio, founded in 2022, with 6 members. We will continue supporting the game as long as you are still a part of the community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alpha League is a Roguelike-based Autobattler game. You will choose your favorite hero, build your heroes with 10 different combat genres, and adjust your strategy corresponding to 10+ different maps. There is also drafting and artifacts involved. Download now and try it out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your hero, play each game with a randomized fun map</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684500/extras/631f14414992c513318a5082bda5dd83.poster.avif?t=1737799883\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684500/extras/631f14414992c513318a5082bda5dd83.webm?t=1737799883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684500/extras/631f14414992c513318a5082bda5dd83.mp4?t=1737799883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build you skills and grow stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684500/extras/b1e9a4996c3c9c3b93dfc0ba5238481a.poster.avif?t=1737799883\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684500/extras/b1e9a4996c3c9c3b93dfc0ba5238481a.webm?t=1737799883\" type=\"